<html>
  <head>
    <meta charset='UTF-8' />
    <title>Application Query - Action Required</title>
    <link
      href='https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700&display=swap'
      rel='stylesheet'
    />
    <style>
      body { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; background-color: #f9f9f9;
      margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; } .container { background-color:
      #ffffff; max-width: 700px; margin: 40px auto; border-radius: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1); overflow: hidden; border-top:
      5px solid #f57c00; } .header { background: linear-gradient(90deg, #f57c00
      0%, #ff9800 100%); padding: 30px; text-align: center; color: white; }
      .header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 24px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .section { padding: 30px; line-height: 1.6; } .section h2 { color:
      #f57c00; font-size: 20px; margin-top: 0; } .query-box { margin: 20px 0;
      padding: 20px; border-radius: 6px; background-color: #fff3e0; border: 1px
      solid #ffcc02; color: #e65100; } .query-box h3 { margin-top: 0; color:
      #e65100; } .required-docs { margin: 20px 0; padding: 15px;
      background-color: #f5f5f5; border-radius: 6px; border-left: 4px solid
      #f57c00; } .required-docs h4 { margin-top: 0; color: #f57c00; }
      .required-docs ul { margin: 10px 0; padding-left: 20px; } .required-docs
      li { margin: 5px 0; } .action-button { display: inline-block; background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, #f57c00 0%, #ff9800 100%); color: white; padding:
      15px 30px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;
      margin: 20px 0; text-align: center; } .action-button:hover { background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, #e65100 0%, #f57c00 100%); } .footer { font-size:
      12px; color: #777; text-align: center; padding: 25px; background-color:
      #fff8e1; } .footer a { color: #f57c00; text-decoration: none; } .info-box
      { background-color: #e3f2fd; border: 1px solid #2196f3; border-radius:
      6px; padding: 15px; margin: 20px 0; } .info-box h4 { margin-top: 0; color:
      #1976d2; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>ASFAAR VISA SERVICES</h1>
      </div>

      <div class='section'>
        <h2>Hello {{userName}},</h2>

        <div class='query-box'>
          <h3>⚠️ Application Query - Action Required</h3>
          <p><strong>Reference Number:</strong> {{referenceNumber}}</p>
          <p><strong>Query Date:</strong> {{queryDate}}</p>
        </div>

        <p>Our verification team has reviewed your visa application and requires
          additional information or documents to proceed with processing.</p>

        <div class='info-box'>
          <h4>📋 Query Details</h4>
          <p>{{queryMessage}}</p>
        </div>

        {{#if requiredDocuments.length}}
          <div class='required-docs'>
            <h4>📄 Required Documents/Information</h4>
            <ul>
              {{#each requiredDocuments}}
                <li>{{this}}</li>
              {{/each}}
            </ul>
          </div>
        {{/if}}

        <p><strong>Next Steps:</strong></p>
        <ol>
          <li>Review the query details above</li>
          <li>Gather the required documents or information</li>
          <li>Log into your account and update your application</li>
          <li>Resubmit your application for review</li>
        </ol>

        <div style='text-align: center;'>
          <a href='{{applicationUrl}}' class='action-button'>
            📝 Update & Resubmit Application
          </a>
        </div>

        <p><strong>Important Notes:</strong></p>
        <ul>
          <li>Please respond to this query within 7 days to avoid delays</li>
          <li>Ensure all documents are clear and legible</li>
          <li>If you have any questions, please contact our support team</li>
        </ul>

        <p>Thank you for your cooperation. We look forward to processing your
          application once the required information is provided.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p>This is an automated message from ASFAAR Visa Services.</p>
        <p>If you have any questions, please contact us at
          <a
            href='mailto:support@asfaarvisaservices.com'
          >support@asfaarvisaservices.com</a></p>
        <p>© 2025 ASFAAR Visa Services. All rights reserved.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>